duct page. For the split layout, set a featured image on the product to change the background. Edit custom block templates in the Site Editor.'=>'Ṣatunkọ akọle lori oju-iwe ọja Cart aiyipada. Fun apẹrẹ pipin, ṣeto aworan ti a ṣe afihan lori ọja lati yi abẹlẹ pada. Ṣatunkọ awọn awoṣe bulọọki aṣa ninu Ẹlẹda Aaye.','Payment plans'=>'Àwọn ètò ìsanwo','Customers choose one of these plans at checkout.'=>'Àwọn oníbàárà yan ọkan lára ​​àwọn ètò wọ̀nyí ni àkóónú.','Sale'=>'Tita','Enter a sale price in each payment plan you want to discount.'=>'Tẹ iye tita kan ni ọkọọkan awọn eto isanwo ti o fẹ lati ṣe ẹdinwo.','Sales limits'=>'Ìdíye tita','Checkout window'=>'Àwòrán àkóónú','Open and close the checkout form on set dates.'=>'Ṣí àti pa fọọ́mù àkóónú ni ọjọ́ tí a ṣètò.','When checkout is closed'=>'Nígbà tí àkóónú bá ti pa','Before it opens, after it ends, or when stock runs out.'=>'Kíá tó ṣí, lẹ́yìn tó parí, tàbí nígbà tí ìpamọ́ ba parí.','Form fields'=>'Àwọn pẹpẹ fọọ́mù','Button and checkboxes'=>'Bọtini àti àṣàyàn','Opt-in checkbox'=>'Àṣàyàn opt-in','Ask for consent before customers join a mailing list.'=>'Beere fun ìmúrasí kí àwọn oníbàárà tó darapọ mọ àtòjọ ìmélì.','Default emails'=>'Awọn imeeli aiyipada','Turn an email off to skip it for this product only.'=>'Pa imeeli kan mọ lati foju kọ ọ fun ọja yii nikan.','Custom notifications'=>'Awọn ikilọ aṣa','Send more emails when someone buys this product.'=>'Ran awọn imeeli diẹ sii nigbati ẹnikan ba ra ọja yii.','Use integrations to add customers to mailing lists or run actions in connected services when an order or subscription event occurs. Connect your services in Cart settings, then choose a service and trigger below.'=>'Lo awọn ifaminsi lati fi awọn alabara kun awọn atokọ imeeli tabi ṣe awọn iṣe ni awọn iṣẹ ti o so pọ nigbati iṣẹ-ṣẹ tabi iṣẹ-abọ ba ṣẹlẹ. So awọn iṣẹ rẹ pọ ni awọn eto Kẹfa, lẹhinna yan iṣẹ kan ki o si fa a silẹ ni isalẹ.','+ Add integration'=>'+ Fi ifaminsi kun','Edit integration'=>'Ṣatunkọ ifaminsi','Integration'=>'Isopọ','Remove integration'=>'Yọ ifaminsi','No integrations yet'=>'Ko si awọn ifaminsi sibẹsibẹ','Add one to send customers to a mailing list or another service when they buy.'=>'Fi ọkan kun lati ran awọn alabara si atokọ imeeli tabi iṣẹ miiran nigbati wọn ba ra.','Refresh mailing lists'=>'Tun awọn atokọ imeeli ṣe','Get new lists, groups and tags from your connected services.'=>'Gba awọn atokọ tuntun, awọn ẹgbẹ ati awọn aami lati awọn iṣẹ ti o so pọ.','-- Select Membership Level --'=>'-- Yan Ipele Ìforúkọsílẹ --','-- no options found --'=>'-- kò sí aṣayan tí a rí --','No Groups Found'=>'Kò Sí Àwọn Ẹgbẹ́ Tí A Rí','Select'=>'Yan','-- Select --'=>'-- Yan --','-- select --'=>'-- yan --','none'=>'ko si','Product purchased'=>'Ọja ti ra','Product refunded'=>'Ọja ti sanpada','COD order created'=>'Aṣẹ COD ti ṣẹda','Subscription active'=>'Iṣẹ-abọ ti n ṣiṣẹ','Installment plan completed'=>'Eto isanwo ti pari','Subscription canceled'=>'Iṣẹ-abọ ti fagile','Subscription paused'=>'Iṣẹ-abọ ti da duro','Subscription renewal charged'=>'Iwe-ẹri iṣẹ-abọ ti gba owo','Subscription renewal failed'=>'Iwe-ẹri iṣẹ-abọ ko ni aṣeyọri','No plans found'=>'Ko si awọn eto ti a ri','Background color'=>'Awọ abẹlẹ','Enter price'=>'Tẹ iye','Existing payment plan'=>'Eto isanwo to wa tẹlẹ','One-time plans only.'=>'Awọn eto igba kan ṣoṣo.','Product image'=>'Aworan ọja','Remove image'=>'Yọ aworan','Set image'=>'Ṣeto aworan','Image position'=>'Ipo aworan','Left'=>'Osi','Top'=>'Orilẹ-ede','Checkbox label'=>'Aami apoti ayẹwo','Headline'=>'Iṣẹ́-ìlà','Product description'=>'Apejuwe ọja','Run only for customers who opt in.'=>'Ṣe nikan fun awọn alabara ti o yan.','Turn on Show opt-in checkbox first.'=>'Tan-an Fihan apoti ayẹwo akọkọ.','Require consent'=>'Beere ifọwọsi','Shown on the product page, orders, emails and Stripe payments.'=>'Fihan lori oju-iwe ọja, awọn aṣẹ, awọn imeeli ati awọn sisanwo Stripe.','Public product name'=>'Orukọ ọja ti gbangba','Leave empty to use the main product title'=>'Fi ṣofo la