ers, tags and ecommerce activity to Drip.'=>'Sopọ awọn onibara, awọn aami ati iṣẹ ecommerce si Drip.','Flodesk'=>'Flodesk','Add customers to Flodesk segments.'=>'Fi awọn onibara kun awọn ipin Flodesk.','MailerLite'=>'MailerLite','Add customers to MailerLite subscribers and groups.'=>'Fi awọn onibara kun si awọn alabapin ati awọn ẹgbẹ MailerLite.','MailPoet'=>'MailPoet','Add customers to MailPoet lists.'=>'Fi awọn onibara kun si awọn atokọ MailPoet.','Encharge'=>'Encharge','Track order events and sync customers to Encharge.'=>'Tẹle awọn iṣẹlẹ aṣẹ ati sopọ awọn onibara si Encharge.','FluentCRM'=>'FluentCRM','Add customers to FluentCRM lists and tags.'=>'Fi awọn onibara kun si awọn atokọ ati awọn aami FluentCRM.','Academy LMS'=>'Academy LMS','Enroll or remove students from Academy LMS courses.'=>'Forukọsilẹ tabi yọ awọn ọmọ ile-iwe kuro ninu awọn ẹkọ Academy LMS.','Gurucan'=>'Gurucan','Add or remove customers in Gurucan products.'=>'Fi awọn onibara kun tabi yọ wọn ni awọn ọja Gurucan.','Heartbeat'=>'Ibi-ibè','Manage community access in Heartbeat.'=>'Ṣakoso iraye si agbegbe ni Ibi-ibè.','Kajabi'=>'Kajabi','Enable Kajabi purchase automations.'=>'Mu awọn adaṣe rira Kajabi ṣiṣẹ.','Teachable'=>'Teachable','Enroll customers into Teachable schools and products.'=>'Forukọsilẹ awọn onibara sinu awọn ile-iwe ati awọn ọja Teachable.','Upcoach'=>'Upcoach','Grant customers access to Upcoach programs.'=>'Fun awọn onibara ni iraye si awọn eto Upcoach.','Tutor LMS'=>'Tutor LMS','Enroll or remove students from Tutor LMS courses.'=>'Forukọsilẹ tabi yọ awọn ọmọ ile-iwe kuro ninu awọn kọsitọmu Tutor LMS.','LearnDash'=>'LearnDash','Grant or revoke LearnDash course access.'=>'Fun tabi gba iraye si kọsitọmu LearnDash.','WP Courseware'=>'WP Courseware','Manage WP Courseware enrollments after purchase.'=>'Ṣakoso awọn iforukọsilẹ WP Courseware lẹhin rira.','MasterStudy LMS'=>'MasterStudy LMS','Enroll customers into MasterStudy LMS courses.'=>'Forukọsilẹ awọn onibara sinu awọn kọsitọmu MasterStudy LMS.','Groups'=>'Awọn Ẹgbẹ','Add or remove customers from WordPress Groups.'=>'Fi kun tabi yọ awọn onibara kuro ninu Awọn Ẹgbẹ WordPress.','MemberPress'=>'MemberPress','Grant customers MemberPress membership access.'=>'Fun awọn onibara ni iraye si ọmọ ẹgbẹ MemberPress.','ARMember'=>'ARMember','Grant customers ARMember plan access.'=>'Fun awọn onibara ni iraye si eto ARMember.','WishList Member'=>'WishList Member','Grant customers WishList Member level access.'=>'Fun awọn onibara ni iraye si ipele WishList Member.','Restrict Content Pro'=>'Restrict Content Pro','Grant customers Restrict Content Pro access.'=>'Fun awọn onibara ni iraye si Restrict Content Pro.','Ultimate Member'=>'Ultimate Member','Send Ultimate Member welcome emails for new customers.'=>'Rán awọn imeeli ikini Ultimate Member fun awọn onibara tuntun.','Elementor'=>'Elementor','Choose Elementor templates for checkout components.'=>'Yan awọn awoṣe Elementor fun awọn eroja isanwo.','Divi'=>'Divi','Use PublishPress Cart order forms inside Divi layouts.'=>'Lo awọn fọọmu aṣẹ PublishPress Cart ninu awọn apẹrẹ Divi.','Oxygen Builder'=>'Oxygen Builder','Use PublishPress Cart conditions in Oxygen Builder.'=>'Lo awọn ipo PublishPress Cart ninu Oxygen Builder.','Gutenberg'=>'Gutenberg','Use PublishPress Cart blocks in the WordPress block editor.'=>'Lo awọn bulọọki PublishPress Cart ninu olootu bulọọki WordPress.','WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce','Connect PublishPress Cart products with WooCommerce flows.'=>'So awọn ọja PublishPress Cart pọ pẹlu awọn ṣiṣan WooCommerce.','WP Domain Checker'=>'WP Domain Checker','Sell domains through WP Domain Checker checkout flows.'=>'Ta awọn agbegbe nipasẹ awọn ṣiṣan isanwo WP Domain Checker.','Cancel an existing subscription as an order automation.'=>'Fagilee ìforúkọsílẹ tó wà gẹ́gẹ́ bí ìmúlò àṣẹ.','Refund Order'=>'Pàdà Owó Ìṣẹ́','Refund an existing order as an order automation.'=>'Pàdà ìṣẹ́ tó wà gẹ́gẹ́ bí ìmúlò àṣẹ.','Webhook'=>'Webhook','Send order data to an external webhook 