'=>'Ko si tita ọja ni akoko yii','Completed paid orders will appear here once customers buy a product in the selected date range.'=>'Awọn aṣẹ ti a ti sanwo yoo han nibi ni kete ti awọn alabara ba ra ọja ni agbegbe ọjọ ti a yan.','Refunds by Product'=>'Pada nipasẹ Ọja','No product refunds in this period'=>'Ko si pada ọja ni akoko yii','Refunded products will appear here when an order refund is recorded for the selected date range.'=>'Awọn ọja ti a pada yoo han nibi nigbati a ba ṣe igbasilẹ pada aṣẹ fun agbegbe ọjọ ti a yan.','Transactions by Payment Gateway'=>'Iṣowo nipasẹ Owo-ori Sisan','No gateway transactions in this period'=>'Ko si iṣowo owo-ori ni akoko yii','Paid transactions will be grouped by gateway here after checkout activity is recorded.'=>'Awọn iṣowo ti a sanwo yoo wa ni ẹgbẹ nipasẹ owo-ori nibi lẹhin ti a ti ṣe igbasilẹ iṣẹ-ṣiṣe checkout.','Orders by Type'=>'Àwọn Ìbèèrè nipasẹ Irú','Main Orders by Product'=>'Awọn aṣẹ Pataki nipasẹ Ọja','No main orders in this period'=>'Ko si awọn aṣẹ pataki ni akoko yii','Main product order counts will appear here once paid checkout orders are tracked.'=>'Iye aṣẹ ọja akọkọ yoo han nibi ni kete ti a ti tọpinpin awọn aṣẹ ti a sanwo.','Customer report for %s'=>'Iroyin onibara fun %s','Back to Contacts'=>'Padà si Awọn olubasọrọ','View Orders'=>'Wo Awọn aṣẹ','Customer activity'=>'Iṣe onibara','Report date range'=>'Iye akoko iroyin','Average Order'=>'Aṣẹ Apapọ','Customer report tabs'=>'Awọn taabu iroyin onibara','Subscriptions'=>'Awọn Iforukọsilẹ','Order Timeline'=>'Akoko Aṣẹ','Paid, refunded, upsell, downsell, and bump activity for the selected period.'=>'Ti a san, ti da pada, upsell, downsell, ati iṣẹlẹ bump fun akoko ti a yan.','Open Orders List'=>'Atokọ Awọn aṣẹ Tuntun','View Order'=>'Wo Aṣẹ','No orders in this date range'=>'Ko si awọn aṣẹ ni agbegbe ọjọ yii','Try a broader date range or open the full orders list for this customer.'=>'Gbiyanju agbegbe ọjọ ti o gbooro tabi ṣii atokọ awọn aṣẹ kikun fun alabara yii.','Recurring plans, status, collected revenue, and remaining payments for this customer.'=>'Awọn eto atunwi, ipo, owo ti a gba, ati awọn sisanwo to ku fun alabara yii.','Open Subscriptions List'=>'Atokọ Awọn Iwe Iṣowo Tuntun','Plan'=>'Eto','Pay Interval'=>'Akoko Sisanwo','Total Revenue'=>'Apapọ Owo ti a gba','Remaining Payments'=>'Awọn Sisanwo to ku','No subscriptions in this date range'=>'Ko si awọn iwe iṣowo ni agbegbe ọjọ yii','Try a broader date range or open the full subscriptions list for this customer.'=>'Gbiyanju agbegbe ọjọ ti o gbooro tabi ṣii atokọ awọn iwe iṣowo kikun fun alabara yii.','Customer details'=>'Alabara alaye','Customer Details'=>'Alabara Alaye','Location'=>'Ibi','WordPress Account'=>'Akọọlẹ WordPress','Guest checkout'=>'Iforukọsilẹ alejo','Customer ID'=>'ID alabara','Last Gateway'=>'Ikẹhin Gateway','Customer History'=>'Itan alabara','First Order'=>'Àṣẹ àkọ́kọ́','Last Order'=>'Àṣẹ tó kẹhin','Products Purchased'=>'Àwọn ọja tí a ra','Subscription Revenue'=>'Ìdáhùn ìforúkọsílẹ̀','Export Subscriptions'=>'Gbigba Awọn Iforukọsilẹ','Upsell'=>'Loke','Downsell'=>'Isalẹ','Order'=>'Aṣẹ','Offer during checkout'=>'Pese nigba rira','Guest customer'=>'Onibara alejo','All time'=>'Gbogbo akoko','No data for this period'=>'Ko si data fun akoko yii','No revenue in this period'=>'Ko si owo-wiwọle ni akoko yii','Paid orders will appear in this chart after checkout activity is recorded for the selected date range.'=>'Awọn aṣẹ ti a san yoo han ni shatti yii lẹhin ti iṣẹ ṣiṣe sisanwo ti wa ni igbasilẹ fun akoko ọjọ ti a yan.','Revenue trend chart'=>'Shatti aṣa owo-wiwọle','Unknown product'=>'Ọja ti a ko mọ','Stripe needs a temporary restricted key with %s. We use it once, install the endpoint, and never store it.'=>'Stripe nilo bọtini to ni àkóso àkókò pẹ̀lú %s. A lo o lẹ́kan, fi ẹnu-ọna si, ki a si má ṣe fipamọ́ rẹ.','Webhook endpoints: Write'=>'Ìbèèrè Webhook: Kọ','Temporary Stripe key'=>'Bọtini Stripe àkókò','Install webhook'=>'Fi webhook si','Create the key in Stripe'=>'Ṣẹda bọtini ní Stripe','I want to set it up in Stripe myself'=>'Mo fẹ́ ṣeto rẹ ní Stripe fúnra mi','Create an endpoint in Stripe with this URL:'=>'Ṣẹda ẹnu-ọna ní Stripe pẹ̀lú URL yìí:','Select the %d events listed in our documentation, then paste that endpoint signing secret:'=>'Yan %d àwọn iṣẹlẹ tó wà nínú ìwé àkọsílẹ wa, lẹhinna lẹ́ẹ̀kan si fi àkọsílẹ ẹnu-ọna naa:','Signing secret'=>'Àkọsílẹ fọwọ́si','Save'=>'Fipamọ́','Add a Stripe secret key for this mode first.'=>'Ṣe afikun bọtini asiri Stripe fún ìṣàkóso yìí kọ́kọ́.','Stripe cannot reach a local address. Forward events with Stripe CLI to %s'=>'Stripe kò le dé adirẹsi agbegbe. Tún àwọn iṣẹlẹ pẹ̀lú Stripe CLI sí %s','Some events are missing, so parts of your store will not update.'=>'Diẹ ninu awọn iṣẹlẹ ń kọ́, nítorí náà apá diẹ ninu ìtajà rẹ kò ní ṣe àtúnṣe.','This account does not let us re-check the endpoint, so no live status is shown.'=>'Àkọọlẹ yìí kò jẹ́ kí a tún ṣayẹwo ẹnu-ọna naa, nítorí náà, ko si ipo gidi ti a fi hàn.','Webhook check failed: %s'=>'Ìṣàkóso webhook kuna: %s','You are not allowed to configure Stripe webhooks.'=>'O kò gba laaye láti ṣàtúnṣe Stripe webhooks.','That key does not look like a Stripe key for the selected mode. Copy a restricted key that starts with rk_, or a secret key that starts with sk_.'=>'Bọtini yẹn kò jọ bọtini Stripe fún irú ti a yan. Daakọ bọtini to ni àkóso ti o bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹlu rk_, tàbí bọtini asiri ti o bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹlu sk_.','Webhook is active and the signing secret is saved. The key you pasted was not stored, so you can delete it in Stripe now.'=>'Webhook ti wa ni iṣe ati pe àkọsílẹ fọwọ́si ti fipamọ́. Bọtini ti o lẹ́ẹ̀kan si fi han kò ti fipamọ́, nítorí náà, o le pa a ni Stripe bayii.','Webhook events were updated. The key you pasted was not stored, so you can delete it in Stripe now.'=>'Àwọn iṣẹlẹ webhook ti ṣe àtúnṣe. Bọtini ti o lẹ́ẹ̀kan si fi han kò ti fipamọ́, nítorí náà, o le pa a ni Stripe bayii.','That webhook endpoint already existed, so Stripe did not return a signing secret. Open the endpoint in your Stripe Dashboard, copy the signing secret, and paste it below.'=>'Ẹnu-ọna webhook yẹn ti wa tẹlẹ, nítorí náà Stripe kò dá àkọsílẹ fọwọ́si padà. Ṣí ẹnu-ọna naa ní Dashboard Stripe rẹ, daakọ àkọsílẹ fọwọ́si, ki o si lẹ́ẹ̀kan si fi han ní isalẹ.','A Stripe signing secret starts with whsec_. Copy it again from the webhook endpoint in your Stripe Dashboard.'=>'Àkọsílẹ fọwọ́si Stripe bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú whsec_. Daakọ rẹ lẹ́ẹ̀kan si láti ẹnu-ọna webhook ní Dashboard Stripe rẹ.','Signing secret saved. Send a test event from Stripe to confirm that your site accepts it.'=>'Àkọsílẹ fọwọ́si ti fipamọ́. Rán iṣẹlẹ ìdánwò láti Stripe láti jẹ́risi pé ojú-ìtà rẹ gba a.','Paste a Stripe key or a signing secret before you save.'=>'Lẹ́ẹ̀kan si fi bọtini Stripe tàbí àkọsílẹ fọwọ́si ṣáájú ki o tó fipamọ́.','This connected account cannot update webhooks automatically. Paste a restricted key with Webhook endpoints: Write, or create the endpoint in Stripe yourself.'=>'Àkọọlẹ ti a so pọ̀ yìí kò le ṣe àtúnṣe awọn webhook laifọwọyi. Lẹ́ẹ̀kan si fi bọtini to ni àkóso pẹ̀lú Ìbèèrè Webhook: Kọ, tàbí ṣẹda ẹnu-ọna ní Stripe fúnra rẹ.','Stripe webhook is configured for the selected mode.'=>'Webhook Stripe ti wa ni tunto fun ipo ti a yan.','Cannot configure webhooks without a Stripe secret key for the active mode.'=>'Kò le tunto awọn webhooks laisi bọtini aṣiri Stripe fun ipo ti n ṣiṣẹ.','Stripe cannot reach local-only webhook URLs (like .test/.local). Use a public tunnel URL for webhook testing, or use Stripe CLI forwarding while testing locally.'=>'Stripe kò le de ọdọ awọn URL webhook ti agbegbe nikan (gẹgẹbi .test/.local). Lo URL ikanni gbogbogbo fun idanwo webhook, tabi lo ikanni Stripe CLI ni akoko idanwo agbegbe.','This connected account token cannot manage webhooks automatically. Please create the webhook manually in Stripe dashboard for the active mode.'=>'Bọtini akọọlẹ ti a so pọ ko le ṣakoso awọn webhooks laifọwọyi. Jọwọ ṣẹda webhook naa ni ọwọ ni dashboard S