 Refunded'=>'Aṣẹ ti da pada','Trial Ending Reminder'=>'Iṣọra ipari idanwo','Upcoming Renewal Reminder'=>'Iṣọra imudojuiwọn ti n bọ','Subscription Renewal Confirmation'=>'Ẹri Imudojuiwọn Iwe-iyẹwo','Failed Renewal Payment'=>'Iṣeduro Ipadabọ ti kuna','Subscription Canceled Confirmation'=>'Ẹri Fagile Iwe-iyẹwo','Subscription Paused Confirmation'=>'Ẹri Iwe-iyẹwo ti dawọ duro','Preview Email'=>'Iṣafihan Imeeli','Send Test'=>'Firanṣẹ idanwo','Preview and test emails use sample order data for personalization tags.'=>'Iṣafihan ati idanwo awọn imeeli lo data aṣẹ apẹẹrẹ fun awọn ami iṣ personalized.','Send to admin?'=>'Firanṣẹ si admin?','Body Text'=>'Ọrọ Ara','Use WordPress Default Notification'=>'Lo Ifitonileti Aiyipada WordPress','If enabled, WordPress default new user notification will be used instead of custom email template.'=>'Ti o ba ti muu ṣiṣẹ, ifitonileti olumulo tuntun aiyipada WordPress ni a yoo lo dipo awoṣe imeeli ti adani.','Body'=>'Ara','Enable/Disable'=>'Muu ṣiṣẹ/Mu ṣiṣẹ','Subscription Canceled'=>'Iforukọsilẹ ti a fagile','Use date tokens {D}, {DD}, {M}, {MM}, {YY}, {YYYY}, {H}, {HH}, {N}, {S}, and custom alphanumeric characters. Example: INV-{YYYY}{MM}{DD}.'=>'Lo awọn itẹ́wọ́gbà ọjọ́ {D}, {DD}, {M}, {MM}, {YY}, {YYYY}, {H}, {HH}, {N}, {S}, ati awọn ohun alphanumeric ti a ṣe adani. Àpẹẹrẹ: INV-{YYYY}{MM}{DD}.','Learn more'=>'Kọ́ ẹ̀kọ́ síi','Custom Invoice Numbering'=>'Iye nọmba iwe-ẹri adani','Attach invoice to order received emails'=>'So iwe-ẹri pọ si awọn imeeli ti a gba aṣẹ','Attach invoice to purchase confirmation emails'=>'So iwe-ẹri pọ si awọn imeeli ìmúṣẹ rira','Attach invoice to subscription renewal emails'=>'So iwe-ẹri pọ si awọn imeeli ìmúṣẹ ìmúpadà','Invoice Prefix'=>'Prefix Iwe-ẹri','Invoice Suffix'=>'Suffix Iwe-ẹri','Invoice Length'=>'Iwọn Ìwé ìfowopamọ','Invoice Format'=>'Àtúnṣe Ìwé ìfowopamọ','Current Invoice Number'=>'Nọ́mbà Ìwé ìfowopamọ Tó Wà Lọwọ́lọwọ','API'=>'API','GOING LIVE? Click the "Update" button on any subscription products created