ta Pixel on checkout and paid confirmation pages. Leave blank if your site already loads Meta Pixel.'=>'Tẹ ID Pixel ti o ni nọmba lati gbe Meta Pixel lori oju-iwe rira ati awọn oju-iwe ijẹrisi isanwo. Fi silẹ ti aaye rẹ ti gbe Meta Pixel tẹlẹ.','Initiate Checkout'=>'Bẹrẹ Rira','Sends an InitiateCheckout event to an existing Meta Pixel installation when the checkout form is displayed.'=>'Firanṣẹ iṣẹlẹ BẹrẹRira si fifi sori Meta Pixel ti o wa tẹlẹ nigbati fọọmu rira ba han.','Add Payment Info'=>'Fikun-un Alaye Ìsanwó','Sends an AddPaymentInfo event to an existing Meta Pixel installation.'=>'Nṣiṣẹ iṣẹlẹ AddPaymentInfo si fifi sori Meta Pixel ti o wa.','Requires a Meta Pixel ID above or an existing Meta Pixel installation.'=>'Nilo ID Meta Pixel ti o wa loke tabi fifi sori Meta Pixel ti o wa tẹlẹ.','Purchase Complete'=>'Ra Pari','Sends a Purchase event to an existing Meta Pixel installation.'=>'Nṣiṣẹ iṣẹlẹ Rà lati fifi sori Meta Pixel ti o wa.','Lead Captured'=>'Oludari ti a gba','Sends a Lead event when a two-step checkout captures customer details.'=>'Nṣiṣẹ iṣẹlẹ Lead nigbati isanwo igbesẹ meji ba mu alaye alabara.','Sends a purchase event to an existing Google Analytics or Data Layer installation.'=>'Nṣiṣẹ iṣẹlẹ rira si fifi sori Google Analytics tabi Data Layer ti o wa.','Requires Google Analytics, Google Tag Manager, or another plugin/theme to load ga, gtag, or dataLayer on the checkout page.'=>'Nilo Google Analytics, Google Tag Manager, tabi plugin/theme miiran lati gbe ga, gtag, tabi dataLayer lori oju-iwe isanwo.','Sends a generate_lead event when a two-step checkout captures customer details.'=>'Nṣiṣẹ iṣẹlẹ generate_lead nigbati isanwo igbesẹ meji ba mu alaye alabara.','Type'=>'Iru','Choose the event format that matches the analytics script already installed on this site.'=>'Yan ọna kika iṣẹlẹ ti o baamu iwe afọwọkọ itupalẹ ti a ti fi sori ẹrọ tẹlẹ lori aaye yii.','analytics.js'=>'analytics.js','Google Analytics 4'=>'Google Analytics 4','Universal Analytics'=>'U