hin ti muu ṣiṣẹ ẹniti, ṣiṣe iṣipopada lati Eto → Itọju lati ṣe encrypt rẹ.','You have %d stored credentials in plaintext. After enabling encryption, run migration from Settings → Maintenance to encrypt them.'=>'O ni %d iwe-ẹri ti o tọju ni ọrọ-ọrọ. Lẹhin ti muu ṣiṣẹ ẹniti, ṣiṣe iṣipopada lati Eto → Itọju lati ṣe encrypt wọn.','Encryption updated'=>'Encryption ti ni imudojuiwọn','Continue'=>'Tẹsiwaju','OK'=>'OK','Unable to update security encryption setting.'=>'Ko le ṣe imudojuiwọn eto encryption aabo.','No matching customers'=>'Ko si awọn alabara ti o baamu','No matching products'=>'Ko si awọn ọja ti o baamu','Searching…'=>'N wa…','No matching settings'=>'Ko sí àwọn àṣàyàn tó bá mu','Try a different keyword or clear the search to see all settings.'=>'Ṣe àyẹ̀wò ọrọìsà míì tàbí sọ ìwádìí di ofurufu láti rí gbogbo àṣàyàn.','Discard your unsaved changes?'=>'Ṣe fẹ́ kí a fọ́ àwọn ayipada rẹ̀ tí a kò fipamọ́?','Reset this email template to the built-in default?'=>'Ṣe fẹ́ kí a tún àpẹrẹ imeeli yìí ṣe sí ìtọ́kasí àkọ́kọ́?','Generating preview...'=>'Ṣe ìmúlẹ̀ yìí...','Email preview could not be generated. Please refresh the page and try again.'=>'Ìmúlẹ̀ imeeli kò lè ṣẹ́ṣẹ̀. Jọ̀wọ́ tún ojú-ìwé náà ṣe ki o tún gbìmọ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi.','Close Preview'=>'Pa Ìmúlẹ̀','Encrypt stored credentials'=>'Encrypt awọn iwe-ẹri ti o tọju','Encrypt %d plaintext credential(s) in the database? Take a backup first and run this during a maintenance window.'=>'Encrypt %d iwe-ẹri ọrọ-ọrọ ni ibi ipamọ data? Gba afẹyinti akọkọ ki o si ṣiṣẹ eyi ni window itọju.','Scan stored credentials and encrypt any plaintext values? Take a backup first and run this during a maintenance window.'=>'Ṣayẹwo awọn iwe-ẹri ti o tọju ki o encrypt eyikeyi iye ọrọ-ọrọ? Gba afẹyinti akọkọ ki o si ṣiṣẹ eyi ni window itọju.','Uploading file…'=>'N gbe faili…','File uploaded successfully.'=>'Faili ti gbe silẹ ni aṣeyọri.','Upload failed. Please try again.'=>'Gbe silẹ kuna. Jọwọ gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','Generating preview…'=>'N ṣẹda afihan…','Sending test email…'=>'N firanṣẹ imeeli idanwo…','Test email failed to send. Please refresh the page and try again.'=>'Imeeli idanwo kuna lati firanṣẹ. Jọwọ tun ṣe oju-iwe naa ki o si gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','Enter an email address to send the test to.'=>'Tẹ adirẹsi imeeli kan lati firanṣẹ idanwo si.','Tax rate ID: %s'=>'ID oṣuwọn owo-ori: %s','No matching tax rates found.'=>'Ko si awọn oṣuwọn owo-ori ti o baamu ti a rii.','%s items'=>'%s awọn nkan','First page'=>'Oju-iwe akọkọ','Previous page'=>'Oju-iwe ti tẹlẹ','Current page'=>'Oju-iwe lọwọlọwọ','Next page'=>'Ibi oju-iwe to nbọ','Last page'=>'Ibi oju-iwe to kẹhin','Mailchimp groups sync error: %s'=>'Aṣiṣe sọdọtun Mailchimp groups: %s','Mailchimp tags sync error: %s'=>'Aṣiṣe sọdọtun Mailchimp tags: %s','Invalid Request'=>'Ìbéèrè Àìtọ́','Missing Fields'=>'Àwọn Ààyè Tí Kò Sẹ́yìn','No groups found'=>'Kò sí ẹgbẹ́ tó rí','%s integration error.'=>'%s aṣiṣe isopọ.','Unable to connect to the integration(s) listed below. Go to the %1$s <a href="%2$s" rel="noreferrer noopener" data-testid="ppcart-admin-notice-integration-settings">settings page</a> to check your integration settings.</p>'=>'Ko le sopọ si isopọ (s) ti a ṣe akojọ silẹ ni isalẹ. Lọ si %1$s <a href="%2$s" rel="noreferrer noopener" data-testid="ppcart-admin-notice-integration-settings">oju-iwe eto</a> lati ṣayẹwo awọn eto isopọ rẹ.</p>','Stripe Connect is enabled, but the destination account is missing for the active API mode.'=>'Sopọ Stripe ti wa ni mu ṣiṣẹ, ṣugbọn akọọlẹ ibi-afẹde ko si fun ipo API ti n ṣiṣẹ.','Use the Connect with Stripe button in Stripe settings to connect an account for this mode.'=>'Lo bọtini Sopọ pẹlu Stripe ninu awọn eto Stripe lati sopọ akọọlẹ fun ipo yii.','Stripe Connect destination account format is invalid.'=>'Fọọmu akọọlẹ ibi-afẹde Sopọ Stripe ko tọ.','Use a connected account ID that starts with acct_. Values like ca_ are not valid destinations.'=>'Lo ID akọọlẹ ti o so ti o bẹrẹ pẹlu acct_. Awọn iye bii ca_ ko jẹ awọn ibi-afẹde to tọ.','Stripe reconnect required for the active API mode.'=>'Ipadabọ Stripe nilo fun ipo API ti n ṣiṣẹ.','Stripe keys are missing or not readable. Use Connect with Stripe to sync direct keys.'=>'Awọn bọtini Stripe ko si tabi ko le ka. Lo Sopọ pẹlu Stripe lati mu awọn bọtini taara pọ.','Stripe is using legacy credentials that are not stored as direct Stripe keys. Use Connect with Stripe before removing payment decryptor support.'=>'Stripe n lo awọn iwe-ẹri atijọ ti a ko tọju gẹgẹbi awọn bọtini Stripe taara. Lo Connect pẹlu Stripe ṣaaju ki o to yọ atilẹyin decryptor isanwo kuro.','Stripe secret key is missing for the active API mode.'=>'Bọtini aṣiri Stripe ti sọnu fun ipo API ti n ṣiṣẹ.','Connect status could not be verified without a Stripe secret key.'=>'Ipo asopọ ko le jẹrisi laisi bọtini aṣiri Stripe.','Stripe Connect status:'=>'Ipo asopọ Stripe:','Connected account is fully enabled for charges and payouts.'=>'Akọọlẹ asopọ ti wa ni kikun mu ṣiṣẹ fun awọn idiyele ati awọn isanwo.','Stripe Connect status requires attention.'=>'Ipo asopọ Stripe nilo ifojusi.','charges_enabled: %1$s, payouts_enabled: %2$s, currently_due: %3$d, past_due: %4$d.'=>'charges_enabled: %1$s, payouts_enabled: %2$s, currently_due: %3$d, past_due: %4$d.','Open connected account in Stripe'=>'Ṣii akọọlẹ asopọ ninu Stripe','Stripe Connect status check failed.'=>'Ayẹwo ipo asopọ Stripe kuna.','Field'=>'Field','Enter a value. This field is required.'=>'Tẹ iye kan. Ẹka yii jẹ dandan.','1 required field is empty'=>'1 aaye dandan ti ṣofo','%d required fields are empty'=>'%d aaye dandan ni ṣofo','Some required fields are empty.'=>'Diẹ ninu awọn aaye dandan ni ṣofo.','Fill them in, then save the product again.'=>'Fọwọsi wọn, lẹhinna fipamọ ọja naa lẹẹkansi.','and %d more'=>'ati %d si i','Product settings: some required fields are empty.'=>'Awọn eto ọja: diẹ ninu awọn aaye dandan ni ṣofo.','Show fields'=>'Fihan awọn aaye','[removed]'=>'[yọkuro]','There was a problem removing your %1$s from order #%2$d.'=>'Iṣoro kan wa ni yiyọ %1$s rẹ lati aṣẹ #%2$d.','<p class="privacy-policy-tutorial">This sample language includes the basics around what personal data your PublishPress Cart installation may be collecting, storing and sharing, as well as who may have access to that data. Depending on what settings are enabled and which additional plugins are used, the specific information shared by your site will vary. We recommend consulting with a lawyer when deciding what information to disclose on your privacy policy.</p>
<h2>What we collect and store</h2>
<p>We collect information about you during the checkout process as well as some basic activities such as the dates you make purchases, or cancel your subscriptions with us.</p>
<p>While you visit our site, we’ll track:</p>
<ul>
   <li>— Products you’ve viewed:  we’ll use this to, for example, send you reminders about products you’ve recently viewed</li>
   <li>— IP address: we’ll use this for purposes like tracking which products you\'ve purchased and what discounts you’re eligible for</li>
   <li>— Name, email and physical address: we’ll ask you to enter this so we can communicate with you about your order and deliver your order to you!</li>
</ul>
<p>When you purchase from us, we’ll ask you to provide information including your name, billing/shipping address, email address, phone number, credit card/payment details and optional account information like username and password. We’ll use this information for purposes, such as, to:</p>
<ul>
   <li>— Send you information about your account and order</li>
   <li>— Respond to your requests, including refunds and complaints</li>
   <li>— Process payments and prevent fraud</li>
   <li>— Set up your account for our store</li>
   <li>— Improve our store offerings</li>
   <li>— Send you marketing messages, if you choose to receive them</li>
</ul>
<p>If you create an account, we will store your name, address, email and phone number, which will be used to populate the checkout for future orders.</p>
<p>We generally store information about you for as long as we need the information for the purposes for which we collect and use it, and we are not legally required to continue to keep it. For example, we will store order information for XXX years for tax and accounting purposes. This includes your name, email address and billing/shipping address.</p>
<h2>Who on our team has access</h2>
<p>Members of our team have access to the information you provide us. For example, site Owner/Administrators can access:</p>
<ul>
   <li>— Order information like what was purchased, subscription information, payment dates and amounts, and</li>
   <li>— Customer information like your name, username / email address, and address information.</li>
</ul>
<p>Our team members have access to this information to help fulfill orders, process refunds and support you.</p>
<h2>What we share with others</h2>
<p><em>
  In this section you should list who you’re sharing data with, and for what purpose. This could include, but may not be limited to, analytics/reporting tools, marketing services (such as email services like MailChimp, ActiveCampaign or Kit), payment gateways, and third party embeds.
</em></p>
<p><em>
We share information with third parties who help us provide additional contact services to you; for example – [enter your third party platforms such as Analytics, Email Marketing, or any others and short description of their purpose. If you have a DPA from that service, this would be a good place to include that also.]
</em></p>
<h3>Payments</h3>
<p class="privacy-policy-tutorial">In this subsection you should list which third party payment processors you’re using to take payments on your store since these may handle customer data. We’ve included Stripe as an example, but you should remove this if you’re not using Stripe.</p>
<p>We accept payments through Stripe. When processing payments, some of your data will be passed to Stripe, including information required to process or support the payment, such as the purchase total and billing information.</p>
<p>Please see the <a href="https://stripe.com/privacy">Stripe Privacy Policy</a> for more details.</p>'=>'<p class="privacy-policy-tutorial">Eyi jẹ́ àpẹẹrẹ èdè tó ní ìmọ̀ nípa ìmọ̀ràn ẹni kọọkan tí fifi sori PublishPress Cart rẹ̀ lè máa gba, tọ́jú, àti pin, pẹ̀lú ẹni tó lè ní iraye si ìmọ̀ yẹn. Gẹ́gẹ́ bí àwọn àṣàyàn tí a ti mu ṣiṣẹ́ àti àwọn afikun tó jẹ́ míì tí a ṣe, ìmọ̀ pàtó tó pin nipasẹ ojú-ìwé rẹ̀ máa yàtọ̀. A ṣàbẹwò láti bá agbẹjọ́rò kan sọrọ nígbà tí a bá n pinnu ohun tó yẹ kí a sọ nípa ìpolówó ìmọ̀ràn rẹ.</p>
<h2>Ohun tí a gba àti tọ́jú</h2>
<p>A gba ìmọ̀ nípa rẹ̀ nígbà ìlànà rira bíi àwọn iṣẹ́ ipilẹ bíi ọjọ́ tí o ṣe ra, tàbí fagilé ìkànsí rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú wa.</p>
<p>Nígbà tí o bá ṣàbẹwò ojú-ìwé wa, a máa tọ́pinpin:</p>
<ul>
   <li>— Àwọn ọja tí o ti wo: a máa lo eyi láti, fún àpẹẹrẹ, ránṣẹ́ sí ọ nípa àwọn ọja tí o ti wo laipẹ́</li>
   <li>— Àdírẹ́s IP: a máa lo eyi fún àwọn ìdí bíi tọ́pinpin àwọn ọja tí o ti ra àti ohun ìdíyelé tí o yẹ kí o gba</li>
   <li>— Orúkọ, imeeli àti àdírẹ́s gidi: a máa béèrè pé ki o tẹ̀ síbẹ̀ kí a lè bá ọ sọrọ nípa àṣẹ rẹ̀ àti fi àṣẹ rẹ̀ ranṣẹ́ sí ọ!</li>
</ul>
<p>Nígbà tí o bá ra lọ́wọ́ wa, a máa béèrè pé ki o pese ìmọ̀ tó ní àkópọ̀ orúkọ rẹ, àdírẹ́s ìsanwo/ìfiránṣẹ́, àdírẹ́s imeeli, nômba tẹ́lèfóònù, àkàǹtì kaadi/ìsanwo àti ìmọ̀ àkàǹtì àṣàyàn bí orúkọ olumulo ati ọrọìsirò. A máa lo ìmọ̀ yìí fún àwọn ìdí, gẹ́gẹ́ bí, láti:</p>
<ul>
   <li>— Ránṣẹ́ sí ọ nípa àkàǹtì rẹ̀ àti àṣẹ</li>
   <li>— Fesi sí àwọn ìbéèrè rẹ, pẹ̀lú àwọn agbapada àti ẹjọ́</li>
   <li>— Ṣe ìsanwo àti dáàbò bo ìtanràn</li>
   <li>— Ṣeto àkàǹtì rẹ fún ìtajà wa</li>
   <li>— Mu ìpese ìtajà wa pọ si</li>
   <li>— Ránṣẹ́ sí ọ nípa ìkìlọ̀ tita, bí o bá yàn láti gba wọn</li>
</ul>
<p>Tí o bá dá àkàǹtì kan, a máa tọ́jú orúkọ rẹ, àdírẹ́s, imeeli àti nômba tẹ́lèfóònù rẹ, tó máa jẹ́ ìmọ̀ tó máa fi hàn nígbà ìlànà rira fún àwọn àṣẹ tó n bọ.</p>
<p>A n tọ́jú ìmọ̀ nípa rẹ fún gbogbo igba tí a bá nílò ìmọ̀ yẹn fún àwọn ìdí tó jẹ́ pé a gba àti lo, a kò sí ní bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí ní títọ́jú rẹ. Fún àpẹẹrẹ, a máa tọ́jú ìmọ̀ àṣẹ fún XXX ọdún fún ìdí owó-ori àti ìṣirò. Eyi ní orúkọ rẹ, àdírẹ́s imeeli àti àdírẹ́s ìsanwo/ìfiránṣẹ́.</p>
<h2>Ta ni ní ẹgbẹ́ wa tó ní iraye si</h2>
<p>Àwọn ọmọ ẹgbẹ́ wa ní iraye si ìmọ̀ tí o fún wa. Fún àpẹẹrẹ, Olùní ojú-ìwé/Àmúgbá le ní iraye si:</p>
<ul>
   <li>— Ìmọ̀ àṣẹ bí ohun tí a ra, ìmọ̀ ìkànsí, ọjọ́ àti iye ìsanwo, àti</li>
   <li>— Ìmọ̀ oníbàárà bí orúkọ rẹ, orúkọ olumulo/imeeli, àti ìmọ̀ àdírẹ́s.</li>
</ul>
<p>Àwọn ọmọ ẹgbẹ́ wa ní iraye si ìmọ̀ yìí láti ran ẹ́ lọwọ láti fọwọ́sowọpọ̀ àwọn àṣẹ, ṣe agbapada àti ṣe atilẹyin fún ọ.</p>
<h2>Ohun tí a pin pẹ̀lú àwọn mìíràn</h2>
<p><em>
  Nínú apá yìí, o yẹ kí o kàkọ́ nípa ẹnikẹ́ni tí o n pin ìmọ̀ pẹ̀lú, àti fún kí ni. Eyi lè ní, ṣùgbọ́n kò lé ni kó, àwọn irinṣẹ́ àtúntò/ìròyìn, iṣẹ́ tita (bíi iṣẹ́ imeeli bí MailChimp, ActiveCampaign tàbí Kit), àwọn ilẹ̀kùn ìsanwo, àti àwọn ìkànsí ẹlòmíràn.
</em></p>
<p><em>
A pin ìmọ̀ pẹ̀lú àwọn ẹlòmíràn tó ṣe iranlọwọ fún wa láti pese àwọn iṣẹ́ ìbánisọ̀rọ̀ míì sí ọ; fún àpẹẹrẹ – [tẹ̀ síbẹ̀ àwọn pẹpẹ ẹlòmíràn rẹ bíi Àtúntò, Tita Imeeli, tàbí àwọn mìíràn àti àpejuwe kékèké ti ìdí wọn. Tí o bá ní DPA láti iṣẹ́ yẹn, eyi jẹ́ ibi tó dára láti fi kún un náà.]
</em></p>
<h3>Ìsanwo</h3>
<p class="privacy-policy-tutorial">Nínú apá yìí, o yẹ kí o kàkọ́ nípa àwọn aṣàyàn ìsanwo ẹlòmíràn tí o n lo láti gba ìsanwo ní ìtajà rẹ, níwọ̀n bí wọ́n lè ní ìmọ̀ oníbàárà. A ti fi Stripe gẹ́gẹ́ bí àpẹẹrẹ, ṣùgbọ́n o yẹ kí o yọ́kúrò ní eyi tí o kò bá n lo Stripe.</p>
<p>A n gba ìsanwo nípasẹ̀ Stripe. Nígbà ìṣàkóso ìsanwo, diẹ ninu ìmọ̀ rẹ yóò lọ sí Stripe, pẹ̀lú ìmọ̀ tí a nílò láti ṣe ìṣàkóso tàbí ṣe atilẹyin ìsanwo, bíi apapọ rira àti ìmọ̀ ìsanwo.</p>
<p>Jọ̀wọ́ wo <a href="https://stripe.com/privacy">Ìpolówó ìmọ̀ràn Stripe</a> fún àlàyé diẹ sii.</p></source>
<t i="3">Owó ní ìfiránṣẹ́','Duplicate %s'=>'Atunkọ %s','Duplicate'=>'Atunkọ','Invalid product selected for duplication.'=>'Ọja ti ko tọ ti a yan fun atunkọ.','You do not have permission to duplicate this product.'=>'O ko ni aṣẹ lati atunkọ ọja yii.','You do not have permission to create products.'=>'O ko ni aṣẹ lati ṣẹda awọn ọja.','Product duplication is disabled in settings.'=>'Atunkọ ọja ti wa ni pipade ninu awọn eto.','Product duplicated. New product ID: %d.'=>'Ọja ti atunkọ. ID ọja tuntun: %d.','Address Line 2'=>'Àkójọpọ̀ Adirẹsi 2','Ending Trials'=>'Ipari Awọn idanwo','End date'=>'Ọjọ ipari','Recurring amount'=>'Iye ti n ṣiṣẹ lẹẹkansi','Subscription Renewals'=>'Igbesẹ Iwe-aṣẹ','Next bill date'=>'Ọjọ iwe-ẹri ti n bọ','Here is your summary for'=>'Eyi ni akopọ rẹ fun','for the week of'=>'fun ọsẹ ti','for'=>'fun','Gross revenue'=>'Iṣowo apapọ','Net revenue'=>'Iṣowo net','Completed Orders'=>'Awọn aṣẹ ti a pari','Failed Orders'=>'Awọn aṣẹ ti kuna','Subscriptions Started'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ ti bẹrẹ','Trials Started'=>'Awọn idanwo ti bẹrẹ','Subscriptions Canceled'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ ti fagile','Coming up for the week of'=>'Ti n bọ fun ọsẹ ti','Coming up for'=>'Ti n bọ fun','Nothing found for this time period'=>'Kò sí ohun tí a rí fún àsìkò yìí','Encryption enabled'=>'Ìpamọ́ ti a ṣiṣẹ́','Payment and integration credentials are encrypted at rest.'=>'Ìsanwó àti ìfọwọ́sowọpọ́ àṣẹ ni a ti pa mọ́ ní ipò ìsinmi.','New credentials will be encrypted when saved.'=>'Àṣẹ tuntun yóò jẹ́ kí a pa mọ́ nígbà tí a bá fipamọ́.','Encryption disabled'=>'Ìpamọ́ ti a pa mọ́','Payment and integration keys are stored in plaintext by default. Enable encryption to reduce risk if your database is exposed.'=>'Ìsanwó àti àwọn bọtìnì ìfọwọ́sowọpọ́ ni a tọju ní àkọsílẹ́ àfihàn pẹ̀lú àkọ́kọ́. Ṣíṣe ìpamọ́ láti dín ewu kù bí ìkànsí rẹ bá han.','Enable encryption'=>'Ṣíṣe ìpamọ́','Add %s to wp-config.php to enable encryption.'=>'Fi %s kun wp-config.php láti jẹ́ kí ìpamọ́ ṣiṣẹ́.','Encryption is controlled by PPCART_ENCRYPT_SECRETS in wp-config.php.'=>'Ìpamọ́ ni a ṣàkóso nipasẹ PPCART_ENCRYPT_SECRETS ní wp-config.php.','Optional: lock encryption on in wp-config.php with %s'=>'Àṣàyàn: di ìpamọ́ mọ́ ní wp-config.php pẹ̀lú %s','Open Security settings'=>'Ṣí ìtọ́ni Ààbò','Encryption'=>'Ìpamọ́','Controlled by PPCART_ENCRYPT_SECRETS in wp-config.php. The database setting is ignored.'=>'A ṣe àkóso rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú PPCART_ENCRYPT_SECRETS ní wp-config.php. Àwọn àṣàyàn ìkànsí ni a foju kọ.','Encrypt payment and integration credentials in the database'=>'Pa àwọn àṣẹ ìsanwó àti ìfọwọ́sowọpọ́ mọ́ ní àkóónú','For production sites, you can lock this in wp-config.php instead:'=>'Fún àwọn ojú-ìwé iṣelọpọ, o lè di èyí mọ́ ní wp-config.php dipo:','When that constant is defined, it takes precedence and this checkbox is ignored.'=>'Nígbà tí a bá ṣàlàyé àkọ́kọ́ yẹn, ó gba ọkàn àṣẹ, a sì foju kọ́ àyípadà yìí.','Key source: %s'=>'Orísun bọtìnì: %s','Encryption cannot run until AUTH_KEY or PPCART_SECRETS_KEY is configured in wp-config.php.'=>'Ìpamọ́ kò le ṣiṣẹ́ títí di pé AUTH_KEY tàbí PPCART_SECRETS_KEY ti wà ní wp-config.php.','Stored credentials'=>'Àwọn àṣẹ tí a fipamọ́','Encrypted: %d'=>'Ìpamọ́: %d','Plaintext: %d'=>'Àkọsílẹ́ àfihàn: %d','While encryption is disabled, new and updated credentials are stored in plaintext. Existing encrypted values are not rewritten automatically; Cart continues to read them normally.'=>'Nígbà tí ìpamọ́ ti pa mọ́, àwọn àṣẹ tuntun àti ti a ṣe àtúnṣe ni a tọju ní àkọsílẹ́ àfihàn. Àwọn iye tí a ti pa mọ́ ti wa ni a kò kọ́ àtúnṣe laifọwọ́si; Káàtì ń ka wọn gẹ́gẹ́ bí àdáni.','%d credential remains encrypted in the database until you re-save it or enable encryption again.'=>'%d àṣẹ wa ni ìpamọ́ ní àkóónú títí di pé o tún fipamọ́ rẹ̀ tàbí ṣe ìpamọ́ lẹ́ẹ̀kansi.' . "\0" . '%d àṣẹ wa ni ìpamọ́ ní àkóónú títí di pé o tún fipamọ́ wọn tàbí ṣe ìpamọ́ lẹ́ẹ̀kansi.','When you enable encryption, any plaintext credentials are encrypted automatically.'=>'Nígbà tí o bá ṣe ìpamọ́, gbogbo àṣẹ àfihàn ni a yóò jẹ́ kí a pa mọ́ laifọwọ́si.','Last migration: %s'=>'Ìkànsí ikẹhin: %s','Enable encryption above or in wp-config.php before running migration.'=>'Ṣíṣe ìpamọ́ lórí tàbí ní wp-config.php kí o tó ṣiṣẹ́ ìkànsí.','Rewrites existing plaintext payment and integration credentials in the database. Run during a maintenance window after taking a backup.'=>'Kọ́ àwọn àṣẹ àfihàn ìsanwó àti ìfọwọ́sowọpọ́ tí ó wà ní àkóónú. Ṣiṣẹ́ nígbà àkókò ìtúnṣe lẹ́yìn tí o bá ti mu àkọ́kọ́ àtìbáyé.','PublishPress Cart security'=>'Ààbò PublishPress Káàtì','Encrypted %1$d stored credentials (%2$d skipped, %3$d failed).'=>'Ìpamọ́ %1$d àṣẹ tí a fipamọ́ (%2$d ti a foju kọ́, %3$d ti kuna).','Do not change AUTH_KEY or PPCART_SECRETS_KEY without re-entering payment and integration keys in Cart settings.'=>'Má ṣe yí AUTH_KEY tàbí PPCART_SECRETS_KEY padà láì tún tẹ àṣẹ ìsanwó àti ìfọwọ́sowọpọ́ rẹ̀ ní ìtọ́sọ́kan Káàtì.','Some credentials could not be encrypted. Re-run migration from Cart → Settings → Maintenance or re-save keys manually.'=>'Diẹ̀ lára àwọn àṣẹ kò lè jẹ́ kí a pa mọ́. Tun ṣiṣẹ́ ìkànsí láti Káàtì → Ìtọ́sọ́kan → Ìtúnṣe tàbí tún fipamọ́ bọtìnì ní ọwọ́.','You do not have permission to change security encryption settings.'=>'O kò ní àṣẹ láti yí àtọ́ni ìpamọ́ ààbò sílẹ̀.','Encryption disabled.'=>'Ìpamọ́ ti pa mọ́.','Encryption enabled.'=>'Ìpamọ́ ti ṣiṣẹ́.','Encrypted %1$d stored credentials (%2$d skipped, %3$d failed). Use Encrypt stored credentials in Maintenance to retry failures.'=>'Ìpamọ́ %1$d àṣẹ tí a fipamọ́ (%2$d ti a foju kọ́, %3$d ti kuna). Lo Ṣe ìpamọ́ àṣẹ tí a fipamọ́ ní Ìtúnṣe láti tun gbìmọ̀ kù.','Encrypted %1$d stored credentials (%2$d skipped).'=>'Ìpamọ́ %1$d àṣẹ tí a fipamọ́ (%2$d ti a foju kọ́).','You do not have permission to encrypt stored credentials.'=>'O kò ní àṣẹ láti ṣe ìpamọ́ àṣẹ tí a fipamọ́.','Migration complete. Encrypted: %1$d. Skipped: %2$d. Failed: %3$d.'=>'Ìkànsí ti parí. Ìpamọ́: %1$d. Ti a foju kọ́: %2$d. Ti kuna: %3$d.','Unavailable'=>'Kò sí','Encryption is enabled but %d stored credential is still in plaintext. Use Encrypt stored credentials to retry.'=>'Ìpamọ́ ti ṣiṣẹ́ ṣugbọn %d àṣẹ tí a fipamọ́ ṣi wa ní àkọsílẹ́ àfihàn. Lo Ṣe ìpamọ́ àṣẹ tí a fipamọ́ láti tún gbìmọ̀ kù.' . "\0" . 'Ìpamọ́ ti ṣiṣẹ́ ṣugbọn %d àṣẹ tí a fipamọ́ ṣi wa ní àkọsílẹ́ àfihàn. Lo Ṣe ìpamọ́ àṣẹ tí a fipamọ́ láti tún gbìmọ̀ kù.','You have %d stored credential in plaintext. Enabling encryption will encrypt it automatically.'=>'O ni %d ìwé-ẹri ti a fipamọ sinu ọrọ-ìkọ. Ṣíṣí àkóónú yóò ṣe àkóónú rẹ laifọwọyi.' . "\0" . 'O ni %d ìwé-ẹri ti a fipamọ sinu ọrọ-ìkọ. Ṣíṣí àkóónú yóò ṣe àkóónú wọn laifọwọyi.','Encryption is not enabled. Enable it in Cart → Settings → Maintenance or add define( \'PPCART_ENCRYPT_SECRETS\', true ); to wp-config.php.'=>'Àkóónú kò tii ṣí. Ṣí i ni Cart → Eto → Itọju tabi fi define( \'PPCART_ENCRYPT_SECRETS\', otitọ ); si wp-config.php.','Encryption requires AUTH_KEY or PPCART_SECRETS_KEY in wp-config.php.'=>'Àkóónú nilo AUTH_KEY tabi PPCART_SECRETS_KEY ni wp-config.php.','Invalid subscription.'=>'Ìforúkọsílẹ̀ tí kò tọ́.','Stripe subscription is not linked to a PublishPress Cart subscription.'=>'Ìforúkọsílẹ Stripe kò ni ìjápọ̀ pẹ̀lú ìforúkọsílẹ PublishPress Cart.','This payment could not be verified. Please reload the page and try again.'=>'Àkọsílẹ yìí kò le jẹ́ ìmú ìmúlẹ̀. Jọ tún ṣe ìkó àtúnṣe náà.','%s order created.'=>'%s àṣẹ ti ṣẹda.','Order complete.'=>'Àṣẹ ti pari.','Creating subscription.'=>'Ṣíṣẹda ìforúkọsílẹ.','Category'=>'Ẹka','Tag'=>'Tẹg','Add New %s'=>'Fikun un Tuntun %s','Edit %s'=>'Ṣatunkọ %s','New %s'=>'Tuntun %s','No %s Found'=>'Kò sí %s tí a ri','No %s Found in Trash'=>'Kò sí %s tí a ri nínú Àpò','Parent %s :'=>'Ìyá %s :','Search %s'=>'Wá %s','View %s'=>'Wo %s','Parent %s'=>'Ìyá %s','Parent %s:'=>'Ẹgbẹ %s:','Update %s'=>'Ṣatunkọ %s','New %s Name'=>'Orukọ %s Tuntun','accepted'=>'gba','incl.'=>'pẹlu.','Order status updated from %1$s to %2$s'=>'Ipo aṣẹ ti yipada lati %1$s si %2$s','Creating order.'=>'Nṣiṣẹ aṣẹ.','Coupon %s'=>'Kupon %s','Included in price'=>'Ti wa ninu iye','Download Invoice'=>'Gba Iwe-owo','Download Receipt'=>'Gba Iwe-ẹri','Subscription status updated to %s'=>'Ipo ìforúkọsílẹ ti yipada si %s','This offer is no longer available.'=>'Pese yii ko si mọ.','This checkout could not be started. Please contact the site administrator.'=>'A ko le bẹrẹ ìtẹ̀siwaju yii. Jọwọ kan si alakoso aaye ayelujara.','There was a problem with your submission, please refresh the page and try again.'=>'Iṣoro kan wa pẹlu ifisilẹ rẹ, jọwọ tun awọn oju-iwe naa ṣe ki o si gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','This field is required'=>'Ibi yii jẹ dandan','Required fields missing'=>'Awọn aaye ti o nilo ti sọnu','Something went wrong, please refresh the page and try again. '=>'Nkan kan ṣẹlẹ ni aṣiṣe, jọwọ tun oju-iwe naa ṣe ki o si gbiyanju lẹẹkansi. ','Please enter an amount greater than or equal to %s'=>'Jọwọ tẹ iye ti o tobi ju tabi dogba si %s','Invalid email address'=>'Adirẹsi imeeli ti ko wulo','Enter a valid email'=>'Tẹ imeeli to tọ','There was a problem with your submission, please check your info and try again:'=>'Iṣoro kan wa pẹlu ifisilẹ rẹ, jọwọ ṣayẹwo alaye rẹ ki o si gbiyanju lẹẹkansi:','Stripe Connect is required but not configured correctly. Please contact the site administrator.'=>'Stripe Connect ni a nilo ṣugbọn ko ti ṣeto ni deede. Jọwọ kan si oluṣakoso aaye naa.','Forgot your password?'=>'Ṣe o ti gbagbe ọrọ igbaniwọle rẹ?','Amount Due'=>'Iye Ti o yẹ','Due Today'=>'Ti a san loni','No items added'=>'Ko si awọn nkan ti a fi kun','Authentication required.'=>'Ìmúlẹ̀ jẹ́ dandan.','Permission denied.'=>'Àṣẹ ti kọ́.','Invalid payment method request.'=>'Ìbéèrè ti ko tọ.','Payment processor is unavailable. Please try again later.'=>'Iye to pọ ju ti a ti fi lelẹ. Jọwọ gbiyanju lẹẹkansi nigbamii.','Unable to save the new card. Please check your payment details and try again.'=>'Ko le fipamọ kaadi tuntun. Jọwọ ṣayẹwo alaye isanwo rẹ ki o tun gbiyanju.','The new card was saved, but some of your other subscriptions could not be updated. Please try again.'=>'Kaadi tuntun ti fipamọ, ṣugbọn diẹ ninu awọn ìforúkọsílẹ rẹ ko le ṣe imudojuiwọn. Jọwọ tun gbiyanju.','The new card was saved, but the payment failed: '=>'Kaadi tuntun ti fipamọ, ṣugbọn ìsanwo kuna: ','Your cart is empty.'=>'Tita rẹ ṣofo.','Processing payment…'=>'Ṣiṣẹ́ ìsanwo…','Your payment is being confirmed. This page will refresh automatically…'=>'Ìsanwo rẹ n jẹ́risi. Ibi yii yoo tun ṣe imudojuiwọn laifọwọyi…','Payment processing'=>'Ṣiṣẹ́ ìsanwo','We are still confirming your payment. You can leave this page open and refresh shortly, or check your email for a confirmation.'=>'A ṣi n jẹ́risi ìsanwo rẹ. O le fi ibi yii silẹ ki o tun ṣe imudojuiwọn laipẹ, tabi ṣayẹwo imeeli rẹ fun ìjẹrisi.','View order status'=>'Wo ipo aṣẹ','Invalid request.'=>'Ìbéèrè ti ko tọ.','Purchase'=>'Ra','Already Purchased'=>'Ti ra tẹlẹ','Payment preparation is unavailable for this checkout.'=>'Ikẹkọ isanwo ko si fun iforukọsilẹ yii.','There was an error, please try again.'=>'Aṣiṣe kan wa, jọwọ tun gbiyanju.','Order Bump'=>'Ibere Bump','Custom add-on'=>'Ẹ̀ka ìmúpọ̀ àtọkànwá','Hosted Checkout is not enabled.'=>'Ìtẹ̀siwaju Hosted Checkout ko ti ṣiṣẹ.','This subscription is not ready for checkout, please contact the site administrator.'=>'Ìforúkọsílẹ yii ko ti ṣetan fun ìtẹ̀siwaju, jọwọ kan si alakoso aaye ayelujara.','You do not have permission to access this order.'=>'Iwọ ko ni igbanilaaye lati wọle si aṣẹ yii.','You do not have permission to access this subscription.'=>'Iwọ ko ni igbanilaaye lati wọle si iforukọsilẹ yii.','My Account'=>'Àkọọlẹ Mi','First Name'=>'Oruko akọkọ','ID'=>'ID','Address 1'=>'Adirẹsi 1','Amount Paid'=>'Iye Ti a San','Product Name'=>'Orukọ ọja','Offers during checkout'=>'Awọn ipese lakoko gbigba owo','Coupon'=>'Koodu Ipon','Purchase URL'=>'URL Rira','IP Address'=>'Adirẹsi IP','receipt'=>'iwe ẹri','invoice'=>'iwe isanwo','Unauthorized'=>'Ko ni aṣẹ','An error occurred, please refresh the page and try again.'=>'Aṣiṣe kan